18:13.831 --> 18:15.196
Mm, mm.

18:15.366 --> 18:18.961
Buttery, with a slight citrus finish.

18:19.136 --> 18:20.467
Hmm.

18:27.211 --> 18:29.304
Ahh.

18:31.081 --> 18:33.049
