18:34.084 --> 18:37.611
Okay, Danielle, we'd better get going
if we're gonna make our reservation.

18:37.788 --> 18:39.517
You're right. Thanks for the wine, Charlie.

18:39.690 --> 18:42.386
Whoa, what's the hurry?
