- I'll be right back.

18:46.664 --> 18:49.861
Gee, Danielle, do you really wanna sit here
and drink with Charlie?

18:50.034 --> 18:51.262
Oh.

18:51.435 --> 18:55.929
You know what? You're right, Alan.
You're a nice guy. You're good for me.

18:56.106 --> 18:59.473
- Okay. Charlie, we're leaving.
Wait, wait, wait.

18:59.643 --> 19:03.135
