and be dull and boring at her house.

19:24.034 --> 19:25.934
That was really your plan? That's insane.

19:26.103 --> 19:28.435
It would've worked
if she wasrt a drunken slut.

19:28.606 --> 19:31.097
Whoa, whoa, whoa...

19:32.643 --> 19:35.077
